sequenceDiagram
    participant ui as Player React UI
    participant api as Django API
    participant game as Planned Game Service
    participant xp as Progression Service
    participant db as PostgreSQL
    participant live as Planned Channels
    ui->>api: Submit action with session and CSRF
    api->>game: Authorize player and apply action
    game->>db: Begin transaction and lock hand
    db-->>game: Current hand, turn and stacks
    game->>game: Validate turn, legal move and chips
    alt Invalid action
        game->>db: Roll back without rewards
        game-->>api: Validation failure
        api-->>ui: Show actionable error
    else Valid action
        game->>db: Persist action and advance phase
        opt Hand completes
            game->>game: Evaluate winners and split pots
            game->>db: Save payouts and final result
            game->>xp: Record each dealt player result with stable hand ID
            xp->>db: Lock user and save XP and trophies atomically
        end
        game->>db: Commit action, results and rewards
        game->>live: After commit publish recipient-filtered updates
        live-->>ui: Public state and only this player's private cards
    end
